{"sha": "d6a2879214605e991287d26ea7bbe5aef390214213ed5bd2ee482e6f221926ef", "body": ["\\textbf{5.} $\\frac{1}{\\sin^2\\theta} = 1 + \\cot^2\\theta$：", "求和，$n + \\frac{n(2n-1)}3 = \\frac{3n + 2n^2 - n}{3} =", "\\frac{2n(n+1)}{3}$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 在 $\\intoo{0}{\\frac\\pi2}$ 上：$\\sin\\theta < \\theta <", "\\tan\\theta$（本科一年级分册）。取倒数后不等号反向：", "$\\cot\\theta < \\frac1\\theta < \\frac1{\\sin\\theta}$，两边平方", "（各项均为正）得 $\\cot^2\\theta < \\frac1{\\theta^2} <", "\\frac1{\\sin^2\\theta}$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 在第 6 题中取 $\\theta = \\theta_k$，对 $k \\leq", "n$ 求和，利用第 4、5 题，并注意到 $\\frac1{\\theta_k^2} =", "\\frac{(2n+1)^2}{k^2\\pi^2}$：", "\\[", "\\frac{n(2n-1)}3 < \\frac{(2n+1)^2}{\\pi^2}\\sum_{k=1}^n\\frac1{k^2}", "< \\frac{2n(n+1)}3 .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{8.} 两边乘以 $\\frac{\\pi^2}{(2n+1)^2}$：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\pi^2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{n(2n-1)}{(2n+1)^2}", "< \\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\frac1{k^2} <", "\\frac{\\pi^2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{2n(n+1)}{(2n+1)^2}.", "\\]", "两个界都趋于 $\\frac{\\pi^2}3\\cdot\\frac12 = \\frac{\\pi^2}6$", "（有理分式趋于 $\\frac12$）。部分和", "单调递增，故收敛，由夹逼原理得 $\\zeta(2) =", "\\frac{\\pi^2}6$：即欧拉定理，此为柯西的证法。", "", "\\textbf{9.} 部分和单调递增并趋于 $\\zeta(2) =", "\\frac{\\pi^2}6$，故 $0 \\leq \\frac{\\pi^2}6 - \\sum_{k\\leq n}k^{-2}$；", "由第 8 题的下界可得", "\\[", "\\frac{\\pi^2}6 - \\sum_{k\\leq n}\\frac1{k^2}", "\\leq \\frac{\\pi^2}6 - \\frac{\\pi^2}3\\cdot\\frac{n(2n-1)}{(2n+1)^2}", "= \\frac{\\pi^2}6\\cdot\\frac{(2n+1)^2 - (4n^2 -", "2n)}{(2n+1)^2}", "= \\frac{\\pi^2}6\\cdot\\frac{6n + 1}{(2n+1)^2}", "= O\\Bigl(\\frac1n\\Bigr),", "\\]", "与精确余项 $\\frac1n - \\frac1{2n^2} + O(n^{-3})$ 相符，", "见\\cref{exo:b2:comparison:11}。", "", "\\textbf{10.} 根的第二个初等对称函数为", "$\\sigma_2 = \\frac{\\binom{2n+1}5}{\\binom{2n+1}1} =", "\\frac{(2n)(2n-1)(2n-2)(2n-3)}{120}$，故", "\\[", "\\sum_k\\cot^4\\theta_k = \\sigma_1^2 - 2\\sigma_2", "= \\Bigl(\\frac{n(2n-1)}3\\Bigr)^2 -", "\\frac{2n(2n-1)(2n-2)(2n-3)}{60}", "\\sim \\frac{4n^4}9 - \\frac{4n^4}{15} = \\frac{8n^4}{45}.", "\\]", "由夹逼 $\\cot^4\\theta < \\theta^{-4} < (1 + \\cot^2\\theta)^2 =", "1 + 2\\cot^2\\theta + \\cot^4\\theta$，并求和：两端外侧的和均为", "$\\frac{8n^4}{45}(1 + o(1))$（所加项 $n + 2\\sigma_1 =", "O(n^2)$ 可忽略），中间项为", "$\\frac{(2n+1)^4}{\\pi^4}\\sum_{k\\leq n}k^{-4}$。由此", "\\[", "\\sum_{k\\leq n}\\frac1{k^4} \\longrightarrow", "\\pi^4\\cdot\\frac{8/45}{16} = \\frac{\\pi^4}{90}.", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{11.} 按奇偶拆分 $\\zeta(2)$：$\\sum_{\\text{偶}}", "= \\sum_j\\frac{1}{(2j)^2} = \\frac14\\zeta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}{24}$，", "故 $\\sum_{\\text{奇}} = \\zeta(2) - \\frac{\\pi^2}{24} =", "\\frac{\\pi^2}8$。交错级数：$\\sum_k\\frac{(-1)^{k-1}}{k^2} =", "\\sum_{\\text{奇}} - \\sum_{\\text{偶}} = \\frac{\\pi^2}8 -", "\\frac{\\pi^2}{24} = \\frac{\\pi^2}{12}$（绝对收敛", "保证了重排的合法性，", "见\\cref{thm:b2:series:rearrangement}）。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $S = \\frac{\\zeta(2)^2}{\\zeta(4)} =", "\\frac{(\\pi^2/6)^2}{\\pi^4/90} = \\frac{90}{36} = \\frac52$。", "启发式地看，恒等式 $\\zeta(2)^2 = \\zeta(4)S$", "（见\\cref{exo:b2:series:7}）表明，提取 $\\gcd$ 后，数对化为互素数对；", "其倒数", "$\\frac1{\\zeta(2)} = \\frac6{\\pi^2} \\approx 0.608$ 是自然的", "候选，即全部数对中互素数对的密度 ---", "这是关于 $\\lim_N \\frac{1}{N^2}\\#\\{(m,n) \\leq N :", "\\gcd = 1\\}$ 的一个论断，其严格证明（含误差项）属于", "本科三年级分册。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 直接求和的误差为 $\\sim \\frac1n$：六位", "数字约需 $10^6$ 项。修正后的和", "$\\sum_{k\\leq n}k^{-2} + \\frac1n - \\frac1{2n^2}$ 的误差为", "$O(n^{-3})$：取 $n = 100$ 时其值为 $1.6449339\\dots$，与", "$\\frac{\\pi^2}6 = 1.6449341\\dots$ 相比 --- 误差为 $1.7\\cdot10^{-7}$，", "仅用百项即得七位数字。渐近修正胜过", "单纯增加项数，效率高出四个数量级。", "", "\\textbf{14.} $n = 1$：$P_1(x) = 3x - 1$，根为 $\\frac13$，且", "确有 $\\cot^2\\frac\\pi3 = \\bigl(\\frac1{\\sqrt3}\\bigr)^2 =", "\\frac13 = \\frac{1\\cdot1}3$。$n = 2$ 时，公式预测", "$\\frac{2\\cdot3}3 = 2$；取 $\\cos\\frac\\pi5 = \\frac{1 +", "\\sqrt5}{4}$，计算得 $\\cot^2 36^\\circ \\approx 1.894$ 及", "$\\cot^2 72^\\circ \\approx 0.106$：和为 $2.000$。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 数 $\\tan^2\\theta_k = \\frac1{x_k}$ 是", "多项式 $Q(x) = x^nP_n\\bigl(\\frac1x\\bigr) =", "\\sum_{j=0}^n(-1)^j\\binom{2n+1}{2j+1}x^j$ 的根（$x_k$ 均", "非零）。对 $Q$ 用韦达定理：首项系数为 $(-1)^n$", "（即 $j = n$ 项），次项系数为 $(-1)^{n-1}\\binom{2n+1}{2n-1} =", "(-1)^{n-1}\\binom{2n+1}{2}$，故", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=1}^n\\tan^2\\theta_k =", "-\\frac{(-1)^{n-1}\\binom{2n+1}2}{(-1)^n} = \\binom{2n+1}2\\cdot", "\\frac{2}{2n+1}\\cdot\\frac{2n+1}{2}", "= n(2n+1).", "\\]", "检验 $n = 1$：$\\tan^2\\frac\\pi3 = 3 = 1\\cdot3$。", ""]}